Frequency: Continuous (real-time/daily) + weekly review
Volume: Enterprise process performance (~5,427 workflows across 188 value streams)
Owner: OpEx Data Lead / BI (links to VS-28)
Participants: BI (VS-28), process owners, Ops leadership
Source: workflow W4066 — Process Performance Monitoring &amp; Control Tower Dashboard</bpmn:documentation>
