Responsible (R): OpEx / Process Owners
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Weekly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4066_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4066_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
