    <bpmn:process id="W_W4067" name="W4067. Productivity &amp; Labor Efficiency Improvement Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual productivity target; labor-cost pressure; capacity need
Frequency: Continuous program + annual planning
Volume: ~6,911 employees + contingent (links to VS-98); revenue/employee target ~PHP 9.01M
Owner: COO
Participants: HR/Workforce Planning (links to VS-103.3/VS-19.3), store/DC leadership, Finance (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4067 — Productivity &amp; Labor Efficiency Improvement Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4067_LaneSet2">
