        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-631 (ensure controlled execution — Productivity, Benefit Realization &amp; OpEx Analytics (PA-133.3).) | - CTL-631: productivity changes validated against service-level and DOLE compliance
Owner: COO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
