    <bpmn:process id="W_W4068" name="W4068. Cost-Out / Cost-Reduction Program Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Margin-pressure; annual cost-out target; strategic initiative
Frequency: Continuous program + annual target
Volume: Enterprise cost-out portfolio (supply chain, opex, technology, procurement)
Owner: COO / CFO
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), Procurement (VS-15/VS-34), Supply Chain (VS-02/VS-06), IT (VS-135), sponsors
Source: workflow W4068 — Cost-Out / Cost-Reduction Program Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4068_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4068_Lane1" name="OpEx">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4068_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4068_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4068_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4068_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4068_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4068_Start3" name="Margin-pressure; annual cost-out target; strategic initiative">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4068_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4068_Task4" name="OpEx/Finance establish the cost-out target and portfolio across levers…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OpEx/Finance establish the cost-out target and portfolio across levers (procurement/sourcing, logistics/freight, energy, technology, opex, working capital), with owners and benefit cases (W4065)
Responsible (R): OpEx / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO / COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4068_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4068_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4068_Task5" name="OpEx coordinate execution across functions (links to VS-105 SCF, VS-110…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OpEx coordinate execution across functions (links to VS-105 SCF, VS-110 freight, VS-135 TBM, VS-34 expense), manage dependencies, and track realization
Responsible (R): OpEx / Function Leads
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4068_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4068_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4068_Task6" name="OpEx/Finance ensure cost-out does not harm customer/quality/safety/service…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OpEx/Finance ensure cost-out does not harm customer/quality/safety/service (guardrail KPIs), reconcile to the P&amp;L, and report to the Board
Responsible (R): OpEx / Finance / Quality
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4068_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
