    <bpmn:process id="W_W4072" name="W4072. OpEx Maturity Assessment &amp; Annual Program Review" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual cycle; strategic change
Frequency: Annual
Volume: Enterprise program
Owner: COO / CEO Office
Participants: Executive team, Audit (VS-21), Board (VS-36), HR (VS-103)
Source: workflow W4072 — OpEx Maturity Assessment &amp; Annual Program Review</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4072_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4072_Lane1" name="COO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4072_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4072_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4072_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4072_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4072_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4072_Start3" name="Annual cycle; strategic change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4072_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4072_Task4" name="OpEx assess OpEx maturity across dimensions (strategy, governance, methodology…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OpEx assess OpEx maturity across dimensions (strategy, governance, methodology, process architecture, mining/analytics, culture, benefit realization) against a maturity model, and benchmark externally
Responsible (R): COO / OpEx CoE
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4072_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4072_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4072_Task5" name="OpEx review the annual program: realized benefit vs target (W4065), portfolio…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OpEx review the annual program: realized benefit vs target (W4065), portfolio outcomes (W4071), maturity gaps, and the forward plan
Responsible (R): COO / Finance / HR
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4072_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4072_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4072_Task6" name="OpEx present to the Board (links to VS-36), set next-year targets, and adjust…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OpEx present to the Board (links to VS-36), set next-year targets, and adjust the operating model/methodology
Responsible (R): COO
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4072_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4072_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4072_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4072_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4072_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-631 (ensure controlled execution — Productivity, Benefit Realization &amp; OpEx Analytics (PA-133.3).) | - CTL-631: annual review with Board oversight; independent assurance option via Audit (VS-21)
Owner: COO / CEO Office</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
